            <div xml:id="d28">

                <pb facs="0123" n="41" sameAs="frus:frus1925v02/pg41"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">860f.51/421: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Minister in Czechoslovakia</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Einstein</hi>) <hi
                        rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of
                    State</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Paraphrase]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Prague</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1925-07-25T13:00:00+01:00"><hi rendition="#italic">July 25, 1925—1
                                p.m.</hi></date><lb/>[Received July 25—9:30
                    a.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>43. Department’s No. 30, July 23, 1 p.m. It is reported that National City
                    Company has advanced $12,000,000 to Czechoslovak Government as installment on
                    future loan, thus enabling Government to take care of short-term obligations
                    which matured on July 1.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Einstein</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
